cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these files, please cite both the paper and this deposit."
title: "Interactive design tool for microfluidic membrane valve seat geometry"
abstract: "Browser-based geometric closure calculator that converts a measured membrane
  deflection coefficient (kappa) into the membrane width and spherical valve-seat geometry
  needed to close a microfluidic membrane valve. The model is purely geometric and
  independent of fabrication route; it was developed and demonstrated for monolithically
  3D-printed valves."
type: software
